type: software
title: "Arsminal: an AI terminal for agentic coding"
abstract: "Arsminal is a free desktop application for agentic coding. It runs several AI coding agents (Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, Grok and others) side by side, each in its own live terminal, in one window laid out like a messenger: chats on the left, the conversation on the right."
